   "id": 631697,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>At a toy store, a family bought 3 toy cars, <span data-math=\"c\">c</span>, and 2 teddy bears, <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>, for</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}3c+2b=46\\\\\\;7c+2b=70\\end{array}\\right.\">\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}3c+2b=46\\\\\\;7c+2b=70\\end{array}\\right.</span></p>\n<p>Which statement must be true?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1222396,
     "content_html": "<span lang=\"EN\"><span data-math=\"10c+4b=116\">10c+4b=116</span> is the same line as one of the equations in the system.</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222397,
     "content_html": "<span lang=\"EN\">The solution of the system is not a solution of <span data-math=\"10c+4b=116\">10c+4b=116</span>.</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222399,
     "content_html": "<span lang=\"EN\">The solution of the system is a solution of <span data-math=\"10c+4b=116\">10c+4b=116</span>.</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222398,
     "content_html": "<span lang=\"EN\"><span data-math=\"10c+4b=116\">10c+4b=116</span> represents the solutions of the system.</span>"
    }
   ],
